---
import Layout from '../components/layout/Layout.astro';

const title = "Privacy Policy | Love4Prompts";
const description = "Privacy Policy for Love4Prompts. Learn how we handle your email subscriptions, analytics data, and prompt data.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} theme="editorial">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 text-black relative z-10 font-['Inter']">
    <div class="mb-12 border-b-8 border-black pb-8">
      <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-7xl font-black tracking-tighter mb-4 text-black uppercase">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-[#FF6D87] text-lg font-bold uppercase tracking-widest bg-black inline-block px-4 py-2">Last updated: June 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-12">
      <section class="space-y-4 bg-white border-4 border-black p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-[8px_8px_0_#FF6D87] hover:shadow-[12px_12px_0_#1482A3] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:-translate-x-1 transition-all duration-300">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-black uppercase">1. What We Collect</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-800 font-medium leading-relaxed text-lg">
          We collect minimal information to provide and improve our service. This includes:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-8 text-gray-800 font-bold leading-relaxed text-lg space-y-3">
          <li><span class="text-black bg-[#FF6D87] px-2 uppercase tracking-widest">Email address:</span> Only if you explicitly subscribe to our newsletter. This is securely stored using <a href="https://supabase.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-black font-black border-b-4 border-black hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-all">Supabase</a>.</li>
          <li><span class="text-black bg-[#FF6D87] px-2 uppercase tracking-widest">Usage data:</span> Collected via Microsoft Clarity. This records heatmaps, session clicks, and general interaction patterns in an anonymized form to help us optimize the toolkit.</li>
          <li><span class="text-black bg-[#FF6D87] px-2 uppercase tracking-widest">Prompts:</span> The text you input is processed in real-time by Groq AI to generate optimized prompt suggestions. We do not store or retain your prompt text on our servers.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 bg-white border-4 border-black p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-[8px_8px_0_#FF6D87] hover:shadow-[12px_12px_0_#1482A3] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:-translate-x-1 transition-all duration-300">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-black uppercase">2. How We Use It</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-8 text-gray-800 font-bold leading-relaxed text-lg space-y-3">
          <li>To send weekly prompt ideas, templates, and updates directly to your inbox (only if subscribed). You can opt-out at any time.</li>
          <li>To analyze general usage patterns and fix bugs.</li>
          <li class="text-black font-black bg-[#1482A3] p-2">We never sell, rent, or share your personal data with third-party advertisers or brokers.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 bg-white border-4 border-black p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-[8px_8px_0_#FF6D87] hover:shadow-[12px_12px_0_#1482A3] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:-translate-x-1 transition-all duration-300">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-black uppercase">3. Third Party Services</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-8 text-gray-800 font-bold leading-relaxed text-lg space-y-3">
          <li><span class="text-black bg-[#FF6D87] px-2 uppercase tracking-widest">Database:</span> Supabase (<a href="https://supabase.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-black font-black border-b-4 border-black hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-all">supabase.com/privacy</a>)</li>
          <li><span class="text-black bg-[#FF6D87] px-2 uppercase tracking-widest">Analytics:</span> Microsoft Clarity (<a href="https://microsoft.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-black font-black border-b-4 border-black hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-all">microsoft.com/privacy</a>)</li>
          <li><span class="text-black bg-[#FF6D87] px-2 uppercase tracking-widest">AI Inference:</span> Groq (<a href="https://groq.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-black font-black border-b-4 border-black hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-all">groq.com/privacy</a>)</li>
          <li><span class="text-black bg-[#FF6D87] px-2 uppercase tracking-widest">Hosting:</span> Vercel (<a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-black font-black border-b-4 border-black hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-all">vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy</a>)</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 bg-white border-4 border-black p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-[8px_8px_0_#FF6D87] hover:shadow-[12px_12px_0_#1482A3] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:-translate-x-1 transition-all duration-300">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-black uppercase">4. Your Rights</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-800 font-medium leading-relaxed text-lg">
          You have complete control over your data:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-8 text-gray-800 font-bold leading-relaxed text-lg space-y-3">
          <li>To request immediate deletion of your email from our database, contact us at <a href="mailto:nishchaydev@outlook.com" class="text-black font-black border-b-4 border-black hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-all">nishchaydev@outlook.com</a>.</li>
          <li>To delete your cached prompt history and preferences, simply clear your browser's site data or local storage.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
